# Language statistics
#
# GitHub's linguist counts committed bytes, so generated artefacts can completely
# misrepresent a repository. This one reported as ~99.4% HTML because 148 MB of
# Plotly output was committed against ~350 KB of actual Python.
#
# The HTML is no longer tracked (see .gitignore), but these rules keep the language
# bar honest if any is regenerated in place, and stop the exploratory notebooks —
# which are analysis, not the shipped pipeline — from dominating the remainder.
#
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md
data/gold/plots/** linguist-generated
*.html linguist-generated
notebooks/** linguist-documentation
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
